<title>UK: Kredietbank unit sets 55 mln Ecu eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank unit sets 55 mln Ecu eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDIETBANK INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDIETBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    55 MLN ECU    COUPON    *3.50 PCT  MATURITY    22.NOV.04</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP BOND  ISS PRICE  101.375   PAY DATE    22.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO YEAR FOUR, 9.50 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.375</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
